Working in Ghana, Emmanuel Hanyabui and colleagues compared the impact on pineapple
growth of different combinations of soil additives, including NPK fertilizer (an inorganic
fertilizer containing nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium), organic compost, and biochar (a
carbon-rich material produced from organic waste matter). Based on data in the table,
